# IB15's OPTIONAL alternate-method file: the "before" shape as a standalone topology, for the
# restart-based version of IB15 (stop ibsim, load fabric-change-after.net fresh, compare). The lab's
# primary, recommended method uses topologies/fabric-change.net instead, which lets you go from this
# same "before" shape to the "after" shape live, via the console's Link command, without restarting.
#
#   Hca1
#    |
#    S1
#    |
#    S2
#    |
#   Hca2

Switch	4 "S1"
[1]	"Hca1"[1]
[2]	"S2"[2]

Switch	4 "S2"
[1]	"Hca2"[1]
[2]	"S1"[2]

Hca	2 "Hca1"
[1]	"S1"[1]

Hca	2 "Hca2"
[1]	"S2"[1]
